{% comment %}
  BFBella — Quickhelp Card

  Renders one card in the Contact page's Quick Help column (Order Help / Product Questions /
  Partnerships / Location). Heading + text + an optional link — Location has no link, just an
  icon + address text, matching production (Partnerships also has no link in production).

  Built as a genuine theme block from the start (renders itself entirely; the parent section
  only does the blocks content-for call) — see .claude/CLAUDE.md's "Theme Blocks Must Render
  Themselves" section.

  LAYOUT: as of 2026-09-07 (round 2), these 4 cards live inside a native `group` block
  ("group_right") nested inside `templates/page.contact.json`'s pre-existing `form` section,
  stacked in one column beside the contact form (which sits in a sibling `group_left`,
  `content_direction: row` on the parent section) — matching production's side-by-side layout.
  The old standalone `bfbella-contact-quickhelp` section this block used to live under has been
  removed since its content moved here, so `--bfbella-accent` is no longer set by a parent —
  each card now sets it on its own root element via an inline style attribute (in the markup,
  which supports Liquid) rather than inside the stylesheet block. NOTE (round 3 correction): an
  earlier attempt put a Liquid palette lookup directly inside a var() fallback in the stylesheet
  block itself — Shopify's theme-block stylesheet blocks only accept static CSS, no Liquid, and
  this was caught by the editor's own linter (not visually). Anywhere a stylesheet block needs a
  palette-driven fallback, set the CSS custom property from the markup instead, never inline
  Liquid into the stylesheet block's own CSS.

  ICON: map_pin, only shown for the Location card — reused verbatim from the theme's own native
  icon set is not applicable here since this block predates that reuse pattern being needed;
  hand-drawn to match lucide's published shape, not rendered standalone to visually confirm
  since this session has no browser/preview access.

  LAYOUT (round 3, 2026-09-07): production puts the Location card's icon to the LEFT of the
  address text, in a row, below the heading — not stacked above the heading the way this block
  originally rendered it. Only the icon+text pairing goes into a row; heading and the optional
  second paragraph stay on their own lines above/below it. `text2` added for Partnerships, which
  has a second, visually muted paragraph in production ("Select the appropriate inquiry type in
  the form...") that this block didn't have a field for before.

  DEPLOY: written directly into this live repo's working tree as part of the 2026-09-07
  live-edit pilot (see claude_docs/build_docs/live_edit_pilot_plan.md) — DXB reviews, then
  commits and pushes by hand.
{% endcomment %}

<div
  class="bfbella-quickhelp-card"
  style="--bfbella-accent: {{ settings.color_palette.color3 }};"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
    <h3 class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h3>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if block.settings.icon == 'map_pin' -%}
    <div class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__row">
      <div class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/>
          <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
        <p class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__text">{{ block.settings.text | newline_to_br }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- elsif block.settings.text != blank -%}
    <p class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__text">{{ block.settings.text | newline_to_br }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if block.settings.text2 != blank -%}
    <p class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__text bfbella-quickhelp-card__text--muted">{{ block.settings.text2 }}</p>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if block.settings.link_label != blank -%}
    <a
      {% if block.settings.link_url != blank %}href="{{ block.settings.link_url }}"{% else %}role="link" aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}
      class="bfbella-quickhelp-card__link"
    >
      {{ block.settings.link_label }}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
        <polyline points="12,5 19,12 12,19"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bfbella-quickhelp-card {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    margin-block-start: 0.15rem;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__row .bfbella-quickhelp-card__text {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__icon svg {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-block-end: 0.75rem;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.7);
    margin-block-end: 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__text--muted {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.5);
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--bfbella-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .bfbella-quickhelp-card__link svg {
    width: 0.9rem;
    height: 0.9rem;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "BFBella — Quickhelp Card",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "icon",
      "label": "Icon",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "None" },
        { "value": "map_pin", "label": "Map pin" }
      ],
      "default": "none",
      "info": "Only Location typically needs an icon here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "info": "For Location, put the full address here (line breaks preserved)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text2",
      "label": "Second paragraph (muted, optional)",
      "info": "For Partnerships' second, smaller line. Leave blank for cards that don't need one."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Optional link"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "link_label",
      "label": "Link label",
      "info": "Leave blank for no link (Partnerships and Location have none in production)."
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link_url",
      "label": "Link URL"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
